# DESK06 run B -- the `#if CONF_WITH_PCGEM` half of the CLIITEM arm
# (`deskmain.c:754-767`): with a window on top, the desktop passes that
# window's directory to `shel_wdef`, and `sh_chdef`'s CONSOLE_APP arm starts
# EmuCON there. `pwd` in the console is the read-back; the restored desktop
# must bring the window back with it.
#
#   C: icon around (37,42) -- double click = down/up/down/up (as DESK02).
#   File drop-down: ENTRY13 "Execute EmuCON" abs y 227..243, centre 235.
#   IKBD: p 19, w 11, d 20, e 12, x 2D, i 17, t 14, Return 1C.
